<title>MALTA: Yield unchanged in Malta bills issue.</title>
<headline>Yield unchanged in Malta bills issue.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Malta treasury on Friday will issue 91-day treasury bills maturing on May 23. The yield rate is 5.0052 percent per annum, unchanged from the previous 91-day issue of February 7, the treasury said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
